    //dialogue
    
                      "Introduction": "Hmm...? $8#$b# Oh oh! So you are the farmer who just arrived. Nice to meet you. You can call me Susie.$16",
    
                    "Goldenglow.Mon":"Hi! $20",   
                    "Goldenglow.Mon2":"Hey, @. Have you heard of chrysoberyl cat's-eye? I read about it in a book recently, it's really beautiful! $9#$b#Hmm... but it's really rare too...$22",
                    "Goldenglow.Mon4":"Huff... Nice to see you! $20",
                    "Goldenglow.Mon6":"@, how have you been lately......$9#$b#If you want to make more friends, you can drop by the Saloon in the evening. It's lively here every night......$16",
                    "Goldenglow.Mon8":"Hi, @! $9#$b#Hmm... want to touch my ears? $33#$b#Hehe, just touch them and you'll know. $22",
                    "Goldenglow.Mon10":"Hi, @! $33#$e#...$35",

                    "Goldenglow.Tue":"Hmm? #$e#What do you want with me? $16",
                    "Goldenglow.Tue2":"Hello! $9",
                    "Goldenglow.Tue4":"Actually, I feel a bit awkward working at the Saloon. After all, it's quite affecting Emily's income... I'm even still living in her house now... $27#$b#Although she told me not to worry about it, I always feel a bit uneasy... $26#$e#Hmm, I still need to think about what other work I should do in the future... $48",
                    "Goldenglow.Tue6":"Hello! Nice to see you again. $33#$e#Uh... is there anything I can help with? $34",
                    "Goldenglow.Tue8":"Huff... I'm actually off today too... $35#$b#By the way, are you free today, @? How about going out for a walk with me to relax? $43",
                    "Goldenglow.Tue10":"What a coincidence you're here, @! Do you know what I was just thinking about? $30#$b#Hmm... of course, I was thinking about you... $35#$e#......$30#$b#Uh... @, do you think this joke is a bit too corny... $34",

                    "Goldenglow.Wed":"Hmm... $8#$b#Hi, hello! Sorry, I was just thinking about something. $9",
                    "Goldenglow.Wed2":"Hello. $43",
                    "Goldenglow.Wed4":"The scenery in Stardew Valley is really beautiful, no matter the season! If you have time, @, you can stop and take a look more often......$72",
                    "Goldenglow.Wed6":"Hmm... sometimes when I look through letters and notes I wrote before, it feels like I'm communicating with my past self. Haha, it's quite interesting......$33",
                    "Goldenglow.Wed8":"@... let me tell you a secret, I'm actually quite good at cutting hair, hehe. $30#$e#Hmm... $27",
                    "Goldenglow.Wed10":"If you're free sometime, @, can you accompany me for a walk by the beach...... I think you'll like it. $71",

                    "Goldenglow.Thu":"Hi, have a great day today too! $33",
                    "Goldenglow.Thu2":"Hmm... Gus has been complaining to me lately that Pam is too fond of running up tabs. If this goes on, it will be even harder to run this little Saloon... $27#$b#Huff, @ you mustn't tell anyone. It won't be good if Pam finds out... $36#$e#Sigh... $26",
                    "Goldenglow.Thu4":"Hey, it's @! $9#$b#Oh, by the way... I recently found that there are many new books in the Museum. I think they might be helpful to you. You can go and have a look if you're free someday. $43",
                    "Goldenglow.Thu6":"@! $9#$b#I've been preparing a little surprise for you lately...! $72#$e#Hmm, want to know what it is...? $58#$b#Hmm, can't tell you now. If I do, it won't be a surprise then, hehe... $63",
                    "Goldenglow.Thu8":"@, how have you been lately! $9#$b#Huff, sometimes I really envy you for having such a huge farm...... uh... and a home of your own... $34#$e#......$30",
                    "Goldenglow.Thu10":"I'm off today, are you free, @? $20#$b#How about we go do something? $35",

                    "Goldenglow.Fri":"Hi, @! Have you gotten used to farm life lately?! $20",
                    "Goldenglow.Fri2":"Hmm... when I'm working, I notice that Shane often hides in the corner drinking alone... $27#$b#I actually want to persuade him, but he's really hard to approach... $36",
                    "Goldenglow.Fri4":"I begged Boss Gus for a long time to get this job at the Saloon. #$b#After all, it's one of the few things I'm good at, hehe. $30",
                    "Goldenglow.Fri6":"Pam and Lewis sometimes come to the Saloon and order Glazed Yams... Hmm, I tried it later, and it's really super delicious! $31#$b#@, you can go to the Saloon to buy some and try it when you're free. Gus's skills are really great! $71",
                    "Goldenglow.Fri8":"...$30#$e#...$8#$e#...$12#$b#Well, @, I still can't do it. I have a friend who likes to stay silent on Fridays. She says it's piety and respect for Yoba. Although I don't know what Yoba is, I still want to try... $34#$b#But obviously, neither I nor my work needs allow me to do this... $25",
                    "Goldenglow.Fri10":"I really like living in the small town these days, hehe... #$b#Hmm, forget it, actually, I just simply like you. Love me, love my dog. I'm really lucky to have met you, @! $71",

                    "Goldenglow.Sat":"Hmm...$18#$b#Sorry, I'm just feeling inexplicably upset...$21",
                    "Goldenglow.Sat2":"Hello. $9#$e#......#$e#...Is there something wrong? $29",
                    "Goldenglow.Sat4":"By the way, do you usually like to have a little drink, @... If you want to drink, you can come to the Saloon. Boss Gus's skills are great. $30#$b#Uh... as for me. I rarely drink. Because drinking still affects my state a lot. I only drink on special occasions... $34",
                    "Goldenglow.Sat6":"Working in this peaceful place actually reminds me of that restless past. $27#$b#Well, we've got to look forward, don't we? $9",
                    "Goldenglow.Sat8":"Hi, @! What brings you here? $20#$b#Hehe, if you're free... I can show you a new skill I've just learned... $22",
                    "Goldenglow.Sat10":"Hi, by the way, @ have you used the beacon I gave you before? $9#$b#If you like it, I can ask my friend to customize some with different appearances for you... $71",

                    "Goldenglow.Sun":"Hi, @. Doesn't the weather feel great today! $9#$e#Hmph... $16#$e#...$34#$e#...$12#$e#...$17#$e#...$21#$e#Ha, you're so annoying...! $28#$e#%Susie doesn’t want to deal with you anymore...",
                    "Goldenglow.Sun2":"Hi, how's the %farm doing? $9",
                    "Goldenglow.Sun4":"If you want to be more energetic when working, @, our Saloon actually sells coffee. $43#$b#Remember to look for me then, I can secretly give you a discount... $63#$b#......$34#$b#Well, if I really do that, Boss Gus will break my legs, hmph... $66",
                    "Goldenglow.Sun6":"Hello, @! How has life been lately... $34#$b#No matter what, you must keep a good mood... $30",
                    "Goldenglow.Sun8":"Here, this is for you, @. [612 243 731]$72#$b#If life is not happy, you can eat something sweet. At least your mouth will be sweet then... $35",
                    "Goldenglow.Sun10":"I'm off today, @! $33#$b#What do you plan to do today? Where are you going? $9#$b#Hey, want to go on a date with me?! $20",
