        "Goldenglow4heart": "Dear@：^Hello! ^It’s been a while since we made an acquaintance. Thank you for being kind to me.^Now I’m just helping out in the bar of Boss Gus. So I haven’t got anything valuable to give you in return yet. But I think it is kind feelings that count. ^It is a bottle of fruit wine carefully selected by myself. I hope you will like it. ^^——Susie%item id (O)348 1 %%[#]A gift from Susie",
        "Goldenglow9heart": "To@：^Nice to meet you. @!^Few people care about me as much as you do, whether in the past or at present. ^It is such a blessing that we can enter the world of each other. @. ^Wish you peace and happiness! ^^——Your sweetheart Susie[#]Susie’s letter",
        "Goldenglow10heart": "@：^I wonder if you still remember what happened between us at the entrance of that forest back then. If you're willing, would you go there with me again?^^——Susie[#]Susie's Note",
    
        "2302010731":"Hmm......Susie, cheers! ",
        "2302010732":"Pam! This is already the fourth glass of wine. When are you going to stop drinking?! $5#$b# Not to mention that you always ask for credit every time you come, which causes considerable trouble for the management of our bar.$5",
        "2302010733":"Despite this, you still should think for your family and your own body...$10",
        "2302010734":"What little Susie said makes sense. You really shouldn’t continue drinking like this...",
        "2302010735":"......$2#$b#*Making a belch*But...$2",
        "2302010736":"But......I have no idea what to do......$2#$b# It seems that all I can do is staying depressed......$2",
        "2302010737":"What are you joking about, Pam?! It is meaningless to cheat yourself! $5#$b# On no account should you continue like this any longer. Think about your daughter! $5",
        "2302010738":"She leads such a fulfilling life. But you keep troubling her. Are you qualified to be her father?! $5",
        "2302010739":"Sigh...$2",
        "23020107310":"Huh?@, Do you need to order something?",
        "23020107311":"What the hell has happened to you?",
        "23020107312":"Hmm...Things go like this......",
        "23020107313":"Hmm...Pam, I think it’s high time that I find a job for you. In no way should you continue like this. It’s bad for everyone including you! ",
        "23020107314":"......",
        "23020107315":"Huh? I don’t feel like getting involved in this......",
        "23020107316":"......Alright. Even you have said like this......I’ll come up with some ideas......$2",
        "23020107317":"Sigh...$2",
        
    
        "2302010741":"Hi. @, Welcome",
        "2302010742":"Hmm...$8",
        "2302010743":"You know, sometimes I shock my friends by accident and it has truly caused considerable trouble to my life...$7",
        "2302010744":"The friends over there tell me to study this book. It will help you improve your current situation...$12",
        "2302010745":"......",
        "2302010746":"What book?",
        "2302010747":"......",
        "2302010748":"Uh-huh?",
        "2302010749":"It may be hard to say. I study these not only for my interest, but mostly for controlling the electricity that bursts out of my body unconsciously.",
        "23020107410":"Huh? ",
        "23020107411":"......$10#$b# After all, I always shock my friends unintentionally...$12",
        "23020107412":"Hmm...$2",
        "23020107413":"It’s true. Hope you can get out of this as early as possible.",
        "23020107414":"......",
        "23020107415":"Hmm. Thank you for caring about me. I also hope to master it as soon as possible. It has a great impact on my life.",
        "23020107416":"Anyway, please go ahead with your own business. See you next time! $1",
        "23020107417":"Are you bored? OK, I understand...$2",
        "23020107418":"Anyway, go ahead with your own business. See you next time.",
    
        "2302010751":"What are you doing here?",
        "2302010752":"It’s so late. Are you still staying here?",
        "2302010753":"Hmm......$2#$b# I’m not in a good mood because I recall something in the past...$2",
        "2302010754":"Hmm...So I just want to stay here for a while...$8",
        "2302010755":"Hmm...$12#$b#@, Before I came here, I witnessed too many misfortunes...$7",
        "2302010756":"Although the time was tough and many people were counting down their days after getting seriously ill,  $8#$b# many people still chose to live positively",
        "2302010757":"en......$12#$b# However, I wonder whether all my friends then are still living well or not after such a long time. $8",
        "2302010758":"@. $12#$b# In my opinion, death doesn’t mark the disappearance of a person. $8",
        "2302010759":"It’s when no one in the world knows about him or her that he or she truly vanishes into oblivion.$7",
        "23020107510":"I believe I will keep those people and things in my mind forever. $8",
        "23020107511":"So......$12",
        "23020107512":"@. $12#$b# Even if we should separate in the future, please remember me...$10",
        "23020107513":"I won’t forget you.",
        "23020107514":"......",
        "23020107515":"Hmm...$4",
        "23020107516":"Hmm...No matter what happens, we should value the present time, shouldn’t we?",
        "23020107517":"OK. Thank you for chatting with me for so long tonight. #$b# I reckon it’s getting late now because I’m beginning to feel a little sleepy. You’d better go back home to sleep early.",
        "23020107518":"......$2",
        "23020107519":"Hmm...I reckon it’s getting late now because I’m beginning to feel a little sleepy. You’d better go back home to sleep early.",
    
        "2302010761":"Hi. @, Glad to see you again. $9",
        "2302010762":"The weather is great today.",
        "2302010763":"What are you doing?",
        "2302010764":"......",
        "2302010765":"Hmm......$8#$b# Having lived in Stardew Valley for a long time, sometimes I would miss my life in the past as well. $12",
        "2302010766":"But it’s a truth that living here makes me feel really comfortable.",
        "2302010767":"Huh?",
        "2302010768":"So will you still miss the place where you used to live?",
        "2302010769":"Life there may not be so good...",
        "23020107610":"But as the saying goes,  #$b# home is where the heart is, @, isn’t it?$1",
        "23020107611":"In fact, life there makes no difference to the life here because all I did then was the same stuff as helping out in a bar, which I am doing now here...",
        "23020107612":"Hmm......$8",
        "23020107613":"And then?",
        "23020107614":"That sounds good.",
        "23020107615":"Hmm...As for the latter half of the story, I don’t feel like recalling it because they give me nightmares. $7#$b# But don’t worry. They are gone and everything is alright now.",
        "23020107616":"I won’t always be trapped in the past memory. #$b# At least I am never upset about life in the Stardew Valley and my friends here. $1",
        "23020107617":"Hmm...$8#$b# No matter what, @, I’m glad to make friends with such a person as you. $4",
        "23020107618":"OK. Please go ahead with your own business. See you next time. $9",
        "23020107619":"Right. It’s true.",
        "23020107620":"No matter what, @, I’m glad to make friends with such a person as you.$4",
        "23020107621":"Please go ahead with your own business. See you next time. $9",

