"AfterTime": "After a while...",
"2302010811": "Wow! @, it's really beautiful and quiet here! $39#$b#Hmm... But where did those green mucus blobs go? $34",
//"2302010811T": "Hmm... But where did those green mucus blobs go? $34",
"2302010812": "That's really strange...",
"2302010813": "Haha, maybe we scared them away...",
"2302010814": "@, if there's nothing else, I'll take a stroll first... $30",
"2302010815": "Anyway, I never thought you'd actually agree to my request. Hehe... $16#$b#Phew... I thought your answer was just敷衍 me at that time... $34#$b#But in any case, I'm really grateful that you're willing to come here with me... $35",
"2302010816": "However... @... $22#$b#Do you know why I suddenly wanted to come here with you today? $30",
"2302010817": "Hehe... $22",
"2302010817T": "Since I left my hometown, I've actually traveled to quite a few places. $27#$b#Although the road ahead was long and I encountered a lot of setbacks, I still held onto hope. $33",
"2302010818": "Now, I've lived in Pelican Town for quite a while. $8#$b#Although my life hasn't improved much, the friends here and everything around me make me feel very comfortable! $39#$b#Phew... It's like I have a sense of home... $43",
"2302010819": "Hmm... Sorry, @. I'm blabbering too much... $44#$b#What I want to say is... Well... #$b#We've been friends for a long time... But my feelings for you are more than just friendship... $38#$b#Woo... I'm... I'm sorry. I'm so nervous that I'm talking nonsense... $27",
"23020108110": "Sorry, please don't do this. I don't have any feelings for you.",
"23020108112": "(Kisses her)",
"23020108113": "...Huh?! What are you talking about! $36#$b#... I'm a bit confused... $41#$b#... $17#$b#Woo... So that's all there is to it? $42#$b#... Well... That's okay then... $26",
"23020108114": "",
// 14 hearts
"2302010841": "Hi, honey! $9",
"2302010842": "Hmm... I know you have a lot to do on your farm, but I still want to ask if you're free recently... $43",
"2302010843": "Um... Could we go to the beach together at night? $38#$b#... Hehe... $44",
"2302010831": "Hehe, we're back here together again, my dear... $38",
"2302010832": "... $27#$b#Woo... $32",
"2302010833": "Phew... It's nothing... $36#$b#I'm already very content with my life with you now. But every time I meet you here at this time, it always brings back those old feelings... $43",
"2302010834": "Woo... I really want to stay by your side like this forever. I hope we can always be this happy. $4#$b#I want to... always... $44#$b#Until the sea... $38",
"2302010835": "Um... I'm running out of words. Hehe... $22#$b#Anyway, I mean forever... $35",
// Sending beacons
"23020108121": "Good morning, @! $9#$b#Hey... Why don't you guess what I brought for you?! $22",
"23020108122": "Look, @. This is how it works! $37",
"23020108123": "Demonstrate it...",
"23020108124": "Huff, look how amazing it is?! (Put hands on hips) $39",
"23020108125": "Aha, this is my special skill, @! $22#$b#These three beacons originally needed to be activated by me personally. But now, after my major improvements, they're almost fully automatic. $43#$b#@... You just need to wear them normally. $30#$b#Um... Their actual capabilities are still a bit less compared to when I use them myself... $27",
"23020108126": "Well... Even so, they're still very powerful. As long as you're happy using them, I'll be happy too! $34#$b#If that's really the case, I'll be really happy! $33",
"23020108127": "Then I won't disturb you. See you later! $4",
"230201081251": "But @... you just need to wear it normally. $30#$b#Well... its actual performance will still be slightly lacking compared to when I use it myself... $27",
"230201081261": "Oh, right. She also gave me a few blueprints for enhancement Unit back then, but the materials are quite hard to come by, so I can't provide you with finished products. $66#$b#So I'll have to leave it to you to try making them yourself... $50",
"230201081271": "Learned how to craft a 'Beacon Enhancement Unit'.", 



//festivals
    //()Goldenglow,()c=spring,x=summer,q=fall,w=winter
                    "Goldenglow": "These foods look inviting!Hehe. $1#$e#You know, searching for hidden gems can be really enjoyable. @, Come on!$9",//
                    "Goldenglow_y2": "Hey. @, Are you ready to collect these easter eggs together?! $1",
                    "Goldenglow_spouse": "Happy Festival, dear! $33",
                    "Goldenglow_spouse_y2": "Hmm. It’s the first festival of this spring. How do you like it, my dear? $9#$e# The Stardew Valley is filled with vigor thanks to these festivals, big or small. $33",
                    "c2Goldenglow": "...Though I’m not good at dancing, I still want to have a try. $4#$e# Wow. How big the jelly is! $31",
                    "c2Goldenglow_y2": "The scenery here is pretty good. The only drawback is that it is only open once a year...$34",
                    "c2Goldenglow_spouse_y2": "Hmm. It’s cool inside the valley. It’s just that the weather will turn hot again soon...$34#$b# Despite this...my dear, would you come and dance with me? I’m ready for that. Hehe. $30",
                    "x1Goldenglow": "The governor comes to taste this soup here every year. As you can see, the soup tastes really good. $9#$e# Hmm...But talking about this, it’s incredible that the soup still tastes good after adding so many kinds of ingredients into it...$12",
                    "x1Goldenglow_y2": "Hey. @, Guess what I added to the soup this year.$30",//
                    "x1Goldenglow_spouse": "Hmm...Aunt Marni said that I can add anything I want, but I really can't think of what to add...$34#$e# Would the soup still be drinkable if I add some alcohol into it...$29",//
                    "x1Goldenglow_spouse_y2": "I can’t wait to taste the saltiness of the soup. Hehe. $30#$e# By the way, @, don’t forget to add ingredients into it. $33",
                    
                    "x2Goldenglow": "Hi. @, Are you willing to enjoy the scenery with me? $1",
                    "x2Goldenglow_y2": "Hello! Will you join us? $1",
                    "x2Goldenglow_spouse": "Uh-huh? Come here and enjoy the scenery together. $33",
                    "x2Goldenglow_spouse_y2": "Beautiful scenery is even better when my Mr. Right is beside me, right? $1#$e# Huh? What’s the matter? $35",

                    "q1Goldenglow": "Wow. The exhibition looks grand indeed...$29#$e# The games all look very interesting. $9",
                    "q1Goldenglow_y2": "How about the harvest this year? $33#$e# Last year, I was really pissed off by that wheel! @, I do advise you not to choose the green one. In no circumstances should you choose that! $5",
                    "q1Goldenglow_spouse": "How do you feel, dear? $9#$e# What a lively town it is! $20",
                    "q1Goldenglow_spouse_y2": "Hmm...This may be the most flourishing festival in the Stardew Valley. #$e# Wow, dear. Look, so many visitors have arrived. $9",
                    
                    "q2Goldenglow": "Hmm...I don’t want to try the maze...$27#$e# But the pumpkin is delicately carved and it looks so cute...$31",
                    "q2Goldenglow_y2": "Wow. The maze this year has grown much bigger. It will take a while to grope inside...$7#$e# Huh? Are you also lost?",
                    "q2Goldenglow_spouse": "Hmm. I don’t want to try the maze this year...$27#$b# However, dear, could you share what you saw inside the maze? Hehe.$33",
                    "q2Goldenglow_spouse_y2": "Wow. Thar really gave me a big scare...!$19#$b#Hehe. What’s wrong, dear? $9",//
                    
                    "w1Goldenglow": "Hey. @, I want to enter the snow house to cast a look inside. It looks good. $4",
                    "w1Goldenglow_y2": "@, Come on! Fighting! $1",
                    "w1Goldenglow_spouse": "I hope you can win the first prize this year easily, my dear. $9#$e#Huh...?",
                    "w1Goldenglow_spouse_y2": "Sis...So cold. $28#$e# I want to go back...$26#$b# Hmm...I can’t go back yet. I almost forget your competition. Good luck! $9",
                    
                    "w2Goldenglow": "Hi. @, The festival goes pretty well. $9#$e# It is really a happy town, isn’t it? $30",
                    "w2Goldenglow_y2": "Hi. It’s the end of the year again. I really enjoy every single day I spent in the Stardew Valley! $9#$b#@, And you?! $16",
                    "w2Goldenglow_spouse": "@, Have you heard the babbling of what Gus said? $34#$b# I think you may give it a try. It feels good. $9",
                    "w2Goldenglow_spouse_y2": "Happy Festival, dear! $33#$e# How was your year? Hmm...The new year is around the corner...$30",
    
    
    //movie
    //Goldenglow(),()t1=SpecialResponses.text,t2=DuringMovie,t3=AfterMovie,s1=Script

                    "Goldenglowt1": "Well. I’m ready. When shall we enter? ",
                    "Goldenglowt2": "......$30",//ok
                    "Goldenglowt3": "Hmm. It’s a blessing in disguise...$8#$b# I think an ending like this is good...$9",
                    "Goldenglows1": "Susie has some feelings...",
    
                    "x1Goldenglowt1": "I look forward to this movie. Hehe.$9",
                    "x1Goldenglowt2": "Hmm. The big face that jumped out just now scared me a lot. $5",
                    "x1Goldenglowt3": "Hahaha. He is rather smart! $1",
