                    "w1Goldenglowt1": "Hmm. The farmland miracle? I’m curious what saved them. $16",
                    "w1Goldenglowt2": "......$30",//newok
                    "w1Goldenglowt3": "Hmm...It’s OK. For them, such a shelter where their spirit can take a rest is the most important thing. #$b# Hmm. I think I can understand them...$8#$b# It’s such a miracle that they were saved by this spirit shelter in the end. Haha. $1#$b# OK. Let’s go.$9",
                    "w1Goldenglows1": "Susie is wondering where the story plot will lead...",
    
                    "c2Goldenglowt1": "Seeing the title, I can almost brainstorm the damn translationese. Haha. $1",
                    "c2Goldenglowt2": "Well. This scene is good indeed! $9",
                    "c2Goldenglowt3": "Everything around goes well, doesn’t it? Hehe. $9",
                    "c2Goldenglows1": "Susie enjoys this movie clip very much...",
    
                    "x2Goldenglowt1": "The movie poster seems to show that it is a lovely and joyful film.$16",
                    "x2Goldenglowt2": "The music appeals to me...$30",
                    "x2Goldenglowt3": "Hmm...#$b# It’s OK$9.",
                    "x2Goldenglows1": "Susie seems to look very happy.",
    
                    "q2Goldenglowt1": "The poster seems to show that it is a scary documentary...Hmm. @, I’m a little scared...$17",
                    "q2Goldenglowt2": "......$29",//newok
                    "q2Goldenglowt3": "I was thinking that I would be scared to death. Haha. $21#$b# OK. Let’s go. $9",
                    "q2Goldenglows1": "Susie feels a little nervous...",
    
                    "w2Goldenglowt1": "I think it is a good movie. But I’m not quite into black-and-white films. $8",
                    "w2Goldenglowt2": "......$30",//newok
                    "w2Goldenglowt3": "Hmm...It leaves behind a big suspense to our imagination...$8",
                    "w2Goldenglows1": "Susie is pondering about the story described in the movie...",
    
